      "subsection": "Mutant Theme Costume Sets",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "The Mutant theme costume sets unlock all-new faces, armor, sleeves, shoulders, gloves, tails, wings, pants and boots."
